$ ssh -i ~/.ssh/b3-1-key.pem ec2-user@43.202.5.32
Are you sure you want to continue connecting (yes/no/[fingerprint])? yes
Warning: Permanently added '43.202.5.32' (ED25519) to the list of known hosts.
